    pr_ref:  # 9e3a
    description: ""  # 9e3a
    fields:  # 9e3a
      severity: "high"  # 9e3a
      statement: "Multiple linker passes report duration_ms=0 AND files_analyzed=0 in AnalysisRun while emitting many edges: type-hierarchy duration=0ms emits 324 edges; enclosure-linker duration=0ms emits 119 edges; decorator-dispatch-linker duration=0ms emits 292 dispatches_to edges. Producing 324+ edges in 0 milliseconds is structurally impossible. Of 84 runs, 17 have files=0 AND duration=0, yet several of those origins are credited with non-trivial edge production."  # 9e3a
      root_cause: "The duration_ms timer is not started (or rounds down to 0 below 1ms granularity) for passes that consume the IR rather than file streams. Same root cause family as files_analyzed=0 issue (pass-13 UUU + pass-15 XXXX), but compounds with duration=0 to produce 'this pass did nothing' record despite real edge production. Affects AnalysisRun emission in graph-consuming linkers."  # 9e3a
